{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impossible Moto Sim</strong> \u2013 Conquer the Sky on Two Wheels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the ultimate challenge for those who live and breathe motorcycles! This is not just a race\u2014it\u2019s a battle against gravity, speed, and fear itself. Imagine tearing through high-altitude tracks suspended <strong>3,000 meters above sea level</strong>, with no barriers to save you. Every turn is a test of precision, every jump is a leap of faith, and every second pushes your <strong>adrenaline to the max</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some say it\u2019s impossible. Others wouldn\u2019t dare. But <strong>do you have what it takes to master the impossible?</strong> One wrong move and it\u2019s game over. Only those with <strong>steel nerves and blazing speed</strong> will cross the finish line in one piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Game Features:</strong><br>\ud83c\udfcd <strong>3 High-Performance Sports Motorcycles</strong> \u2013 Choose your beast and take on the challenge.<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>A Huge Variety of Levels</strong> \u2013 Each more extreme than the last.<br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Obstacles Everywhere</strong> \u2013 Every track is designed to test your skill and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a race. <strong>It\u2019s survival.</strong> Are you ready to face the ultimate two-wheel test?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621400?t=1767087924","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621400/0d6d4482c28579ae0c9625e110b864d24b5ab31f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767087924","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621400/31d936a90ca24f6f03fa1b0bf84843567444870d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767087924","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621400/31d936a90ca24f6f03fa